    <selectionEntry name="Khorne Lord of Skulls (Homebrew)" id="76e8-0006-d8f4-e536" collective="false" hidden="true" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <comment>7th edition rules and vdr inspired
War Machine-Walker
Armor 13-13-11 = 20+60+20=100
Lumbering = 20
War Machine CCW = 10x4x4=160
Daemonic Possession = 20
Destroyer=25</comment>
