            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="e24a-6018-20cf-d76c">The Aspiring Sorcerer who leads the squad is a psyker. If the Aspiring Sorcerer is killed, the Thousand Sons Marines roll and a single dice for their Slow and Purposeful movement, unless the squad includes and Independent Character with the Mark of Tzeentch from the beginning of the turn.</characteristic>
